      "sourceTextSha256": "65ad7c0024c450d857636acf5ea4ea7fb8a97ca597243a6613cf8ce3fa09850f",
      "text": "Day 13 · After breakfast, discover the historic part of Rio, then a half-day excursion to Corcovado Mountain: an eco-friendly train climbs through the Tijuca Forest, home to monkeys and exotic birds, to the summit, 710 metres above sea level, where the 38-metre statue of Christ the Redeemer, built in 1931, overlooks the Rio–Niterói Bridge, Guanabara Bay, the Botanical Garden, Maracanã Stadium and Sugar Loaf.",
